1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
"A Winter Sun Wakes the Wind in Spring Hills' Dream Extra Episode"

2
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:15,600
(Episode 2: First Kiss)

3
00:00:33,719 --> 00:00:35,840
I'm meeting with the
event organizer tonight.

4
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:37,520
Have dinner on your own.

5
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,079
Man or woman?

6
00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:45,600
None of your business.

7
00:00:56,920 --> 00:00:59,600
I'm your husband. Of
course it's my business.

8
00:01:10,560 --> 00:01:11,640
Does it look good?

9
00:01:17,359 --> 00:01:19,959
Yellowing your hair just
to meet the organizer?

10
00:01:20,760 --> 00:01:23,000
"Yellow" is so tacky. It's blond.

11
00:01:23,719 --> 00:01:24,719
Right.

12
00:01:25,159 --> 00:01:26,159
Blondie.

13
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:35,560
I wanted nine charity shows,

14
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:37,480
but the old guy would only offer three.

15
00:01:50,079 --> 00:01:51,120
Old geezer.

16
00:01:56,519 --> 00:01:58,840
I offered to cover the
cost for the other six,

17
00:01:59,319 --> 00:02:01,680
so he could announce
nine shows to the public.

18
00:02:02,159 --> 00:02:03,159
He refused.

19
00:02:04,319 --> 00:02:05,400
He didn't want to lie.

20
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:07,680
Afraid of the public backlash.

21
00:02:13,199 --> 00:02:15,399
What does any of that have
to do with dyeing your hair?

22
00:02:17,879 --> 00:02:19,039
Nothing.

23
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:21,400
I want the truth.

24
00:02:26,759 --> 00:02:29,840
I just felt like it.

25
00:02:49,319 --> 00:02:50,919
Does the old guy like blonds?

26
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:55,199
I don't know about him,

27
00:02:56,759 --> 00:02:58,120
but this young guy does.

28
00:03:51,879 --> 00:03:53,816
I barely walked out the door
and you're already calling.

29
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:55,135
Are you ever going to let me leave?

30
00:03:55,159 --> 00:03:56,599
Be back before nine.

31
00:03:59,319 --> 00:04:00,319
Got it.

32
00:04:00,879 --> 00:04:01,879
Be good.

33
00:04:02,719 --> 00:04:04,319
I won't be good if you're not around.

34
00:04:24,279 --> 00:04:25,279
All the actors have arrived.

35
00:04:25,280 --> 00:04:27,318
Let's set the audition order in a bit.

36
00:04:27,319 --> 00:04:28,319
Okay.

37
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:32,120
Hello, Director Lizzy?

38
00:04:32,519 --> 00:04:33,560
Have you arrived yet?

39
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:35,639
Oh, stuck in traffic?

40
00:04:35,879 --> 00:04:36,759
No problem at all.

41
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:38,120
Take your time, no rush.

42
00:04:39,519 --> 00:04:40,720
The GPS isn't accurate?

43
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:43,438
Let me pull up the other map app

44
00:04:43,439 --> 00:04:44,719
and send you the location again.

45
00:04:44,879 --> 00:04:45,879
Okay.

46
00:04:46,920 --> 00:04:48,159
The director can't make it for now.

47
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:49,935
Hand out the audition
sides to them in a bit.

48
00:04:49,959 --> 00:04:50,959
Will do.

49
00:05:01,350 --> 00:05:03,543
[Summer Epilogue auditions]

50
00:05:03,639 --> 00:05:04,639
Um, excuse me, sir?

51
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:08,240
Is this the audition for
"Summer's Epilogue"?

52
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:10,000
Yes. Come on in.

53
00:05:14,879 --> 00:05:17,279
Am I early?

54
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:18,720
No.

55
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:20,120
You're right on time.

56
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:26,439
Why don't you introduce yourself first?

57
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:28,160
Sure.

58
00:05:28,839 --> 00:05:31,120
Hello, sir. My name is Feng Qinglang.

59
00:05:31,279 --> 00:05:32,600
I'm 21 years old,

60
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:35,360
studying at Jinling Media College.

61
00:05:35,519 --> 00:05:37,879
My hobbies include hiking

62
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,240
and watching classic movies.

63
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:41,120
My favorite film is.

64
00:05:41,199 --> 00:05:42,199
"Ye Xiao'e."

65
00:05:48,199 --> 00:05:49,839
Are you familiar with this genre?

66
00:05:50,639 --> 00:05:51,639
Yes, sir.

67
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:53,160
I've watched several titles.

68
00:05:54,199 --> 00:05:55,800
Are you comfortable doing kiss scenes?

69
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:57,360
Yes, I can do that.

70
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:03,120
How far are you willing to go?

71
00:06:05,560 --> 00:06:07,040
Well, I think I'm open to anything.

72
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:09,160
An actor shouldn't limit himself.

73
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:13,959
Can you do a kiss scene for us right now?

74
00:06:14,519 --> 00:06:15,519
Absolutely, sir.

75
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:19,279
Do I have a scene partner?

76
00:06:19,519 --> 00:06:20,519
Yes.

77
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:27,360
Can I read it with you?

78
00:06:29,879 --> 00:06:30,879
Sure thing, sir.

79
00:06:30,959 --> 00:06:32,879
Which part are we doing?

80
00:06:33,199 --> 00:06:34,600
I've memorized all the lines.

81
00:06:36,199 --> 00:06:37,399
Just kiss me.

82
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:22,920
Having fun?

83
00:07:25,199 --> 00:07:27,079
I was just trying to stop
you from auditioning.

84
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:29,480
That way, you wouldn't
meet the young Shi Yuhao.

85
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:31,120
Excuses.

86
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:38,319
Why are you back so early?

87
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:40,040
Didn't you say nine?

88
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:43,600
If I hadn't come back,

89
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:46,120
would you have auditioned a bed scene next?

90
00:07:46,519 --> 00:07:49,120
What's wrong, did I ruin your fun?

91
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:51,319
It was you either way.

92
00:07:52,160 --> 00:07:53,880
The one in the parallel universe wasn't me.

93
00:07:56,839 --> 00:07:59,160
Then you should travel back
to find a younger me, too.

94
00:08:00,759 --> 00:08:02,360
What, go back to change your diapers?

95
00:08:16,399 --> 00:08:19,279
Xu Changyang, you think
I'm getting old, don't you?

96
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:21,640
You jump at any chance
to chase someone younger.

97
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:25,600
You're sleeping on the couch tonight.

98
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:01,360
Are you mad?

99
00:09:03,919 --> 00:09:05,440
I'll throw the tea ball away.

100
00:09:05,519 --> 00:09:06,759
I won't play with it anymore.

101
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:09,160
I don't have the energy to stay mad at you.

102
00:09:19,360 --> 00:09:21,200
Are you always that
uninhibited when acting?

103
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:23,080
Kissing a stranger just like that?

104
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:26,600
I wouldn't have kissed anyone else.

105
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:30,255
You traveled back in time
just now too, didn't you?

106
00:09:30,279 --> 00:09:31,279
No.

107
00:09:31,639 --> 00:09:32,639
Stubborn as always.

108
00:09:33,120 --> 00:09:34,120
I didn't.

109
00:09:37,519 --> 00:09:38,519
Hey.

110
00:09:51,519 --> 00:09:52,519
Xu Changyang.

111
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:55,759
I knew you were getting restless.

112
00:09:56,519 --> 00:09:57,919
You just can't help yourself.

113
00:09:58,279 --> 00:10:00,360
Seeing a 21-year-old Feng Qinglang,

114
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:02,400
you completely lost your head, didn't you?

115
00:10:05,720 --> 00:10:06,919
I gave you a chance

116
00:10:07,799 --> 00:10:09,839
to give me your first kiss.
What's wrong with that?

117
00:10:12,759 --> 00:10:14,120
You actually care about that?

118
00:10:15,080 --> 00:10:17,600
I don't care. I just wanted it.

119
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:20,200
You wanted it?

120
00:10:20,759 --> 00:10:22,000
If you want it, it's yours.

121
00:12:21,399 --> 00:12:22,399
Now confess.

122
00:12:23,399 --> 00:12:24,559
Where did you come from?

123
00:12:25,039 --> 00:12:26,240
I said, start talking.

124
00:12:27,399 --> 00:12:28,919
Where did you find this body double?

125
00:12:29,039 --> 00:12:31,535
Tricking me into thinking it was time
travel with some high-tech gadget?

126
00:12:31,559 --> 00:12:32,959
You saw the time travel yourself.

127
00:12:32,960 --> 00:12:34,015
I couldn't have faked that.

128
00:12:34,039 --> 00:12:35,559
Seeing isn't always believing.

129
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:36,960
Come clean.

130
00:12:39,559 --> 00:12:40,638
What is this place...

131
00:12:40,639 --> 00:12:41,639
Shut up.

132
00:12:42,039 --> 00:12:43,399
You don't get a say here.

133
00:12:44,919 --> 00:12:46,735
If you're hiring a double, at least
pick someone who looks like me.

134
00:12:46,759 --> 00:12:49,359
Did my voice really sound that
fake and breathy when I was young?

135
00:12:49,759 --> 00:12:50,839
I wasn't around back then.

136
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:51,840
How would I know?

137
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:54,320
Feng Qinglang.

138
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:55,639
Yeah?

139
00:12:55,639 --> 00:12:56,639
Mm.

140
00:12:57,179 --> 00:13:01,520
(Wilderness lies at the end of the road)
